        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Magical Drop is a 1995 competitive arcade puzzle game created by Data East Corporation. It is the inaugural game of the Magical Drop series. Magical Drop is based on a game called Drop-Drop created by Russ Ltd, a Russian company.\n\nThe arcade game received an updated version named Magical Drop Plus 1! that features aesthetic improvements and also introduces a \"Solo Play\" mode. Magical Drop Plus 1! was released in North America and Europe as Chain Reaction; in this version, the puzzle pieces are changed from spherical Drops to various items (such as food or celestial bodies) and the character-unique voice acting is replaced by a single male narrator.\n\nAll versions of the original arcade game were developed for Data East's \"MLC\" arcade hardware.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Magical Drop es un juego de puzles competitivo de arcade creado por Data East Corporation en 1995. Es el primer juego de la serie Magical Drop. Está basado en un juego llamado Drop-Drop, creado por Russ Ltd, una empresa rusa.\n\nLa versión de arcade recibió una actualización llamada Magical Drop Plus 1!, que incluye mejoras estéticas y también introduce un modo «Solo Play». Magical Drop Plus 1! se lanzó en América del Norte y Europa con el nombre de Chain Reaction; en esta versión, las piezas del puzle pasan de ser gotas esféricas a diversos objetos (como comida o cuerpos celestes), y las voces de cada personaje se sustituyen por un único narrador masculino.\n\nTodas las versiones del juego original de arcade se desarrollaron para el hardware arcade «MLC» de Data East.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1995",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
